nings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EC 2019 Q2","e":"ec","d":"2019-08-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alberto Consuegra","x":"It is important to mention that during the second quarter, the Ministry of Mines established the new crude transportation tariffs, which will be in effect from the second half of 2019 until June 30th, 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/13/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EC 2019 Q2","e":"ec","d":"2019-08-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Milena Lopez","x":"Lastly, it is important to highlight that during the second quarter, the Ministry of Mines and energy published tariffs that have been in place since July 2019 and will be valid through June 30th, 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/13/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EC 2019 Q3","e":"ec","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Milena Lopez","x":"First, effective July 1st of this year, we have the new tariff for the oil pipelines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EC 2020 Q1","e":"ec","d":"2020-05-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ana Milena Lopez Rocha","x":"So the first component of the tariff that's important to bear in mind is that they're temporary.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EC 2020 Q1","e":"ec","d":"2020-05-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ana Milena Lopez Rocha","x":"And third, the way we have tailored the discounts is based on the fact that we have tariffs based in dollars.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EC 2020 Q2","e":"ec","d":"2020-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alberto Consuegra Granger","x":"Midstream companies offered commercial release, such as discounts and financing of the transport tariffs up to six months and in certain cases, in volume requirements on the shipper pay contracts were made more flexible.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EC 2020 Q2","e":"ec","d":"2020-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alberto Consuegra Granger","x":"Lifting cost was $7.1 per barrel during the first half of the year with efforts focused on tariff renegotiation, infrastructure optimization, energy matrix and exchange rate impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EC 2020 Q2","e":"ec","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Felipe Bayon Pardo","x":"It's important for us, as I was saying it's not only important for the environmental side of things and reduction in emissions, but also for cost savings and clearly where we are and with prices where we are, it's good to have sources of efficiency as well from energy as such.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"EC 2020 Q3","e":"ec","d":"2020-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alberto Consuegra Granger","x":"Explained mainly by the renegotiation of tariffs, decrease and shift of activities and the exchange rate effect.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2020 Q3","e":"ec","d":"2020-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alberto Consuegra Granger","x":"And they pay a total overall tariff in the system that is lower when you compare second quarter to third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2020 Q4","e":"ec","d":"2021-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ana Milena Lopez Rocha","x":"And then 20% of those revenues are actually peso based, which are revenues from the refined product pipelines, which all have tariffs that are denominated in pesos.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/03/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2020 Q4","e":"ec","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Felipe Bayon Pardo","x":"We made a choice and it was a conscious choice at the back end of 3Q to increase the scope of the program and accelerate the implementation of the program because it adds value to the business, it's consistent with our streamlining efforts into the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/03/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2021 Q1","e":"ec","d":"2021-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Felipe Bayon Pardo","x":"And then I'm going to ask Milena Lopez to help us with your question on some of the things that we did during last year in support of small producers in Colombia with respect to transportation tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2021 Q1","e":"ec","d":"2021-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Milena Lopez","x":"We had payment terms that allowed producers to defer payment of transport tariffs up to six months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2021 Q1","e":"ec","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alberto Consuegra Granger","x":"So all in all, we see that we're going to be able to maintain our guidance of anything between $7.5 and $8 per barrel throughout the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2021 Q2","e":"ec","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Felipe Bayon Pardo","x":"Our commercial strategy contributed with more than $120 million to the group's EBITDA during the quarter, mainly as a result of the purchase of new crudes for the refineries, increased asphalt sales and energy cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2021 Q3","e":"ec","d":"2021-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Felipe Bayon","x":"Because sector inflation and some of the service providers will come back knocking on our door and wanting to -- for us to basically accept the pass-through on some of those costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2021 Q3","e":"ec","d":"2021-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Felipe Bayon","x":"Those can be passed through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/ecopetrol-sa-ec-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2025 Q1","e":"ec","d":"2025-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Camilo Barco","x":"Because this tariff of 19% means that we have to pay that percentage over the imports.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/ecopetrol-ec-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2025 Q1","e":"ec","d":"2025-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Rafael Guzman","x":"…and detailed engineering for connecting the gas to the national transportation system as well as efforts with the Ministry of Mines and Energy and the Energy and Gas Regulatory Commission to enable gas evacuation to the national system, along with any required adjustments to the tariff system.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/ecopetrol-ec-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EC 2025 Q2","e":"ec","d":"2025-08-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ricardo Roa Barragan","x":"Amon